# L §2.3 (round 8) `row = qid [rowkeys] "=" (value | expr) rowmeta`, "expr: only in a scenario's version, §6.4,
# LOAD-SCENARIO otherwise"; L §6.4 "A scenario row may be an expression over the base's facts". In the base's
# version it is refused LOAD-SCENARIO, with L §8.3's message (round 9) "an expression row outside a scenario".
=== m.tally
model m
  tally 2
  on 2026-10-20
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31

source s "s"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01
input a: num PLN
input b: num PLN

version v
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2026-01-01
  a = 1.00 PLN
  b = a * 2

ask q: b
=== expect
refused: LOAD-SCENARIO an expression row outside a scenario (m.tally:17)
